{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105319","id":2455484530,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6SW7hy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105319","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105319.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105319.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105319","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105319/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105319/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105319/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f9ced2b9dc4d5aaa0935840d82b60720d189b4c3","number":105319,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Update `GDScriptLanguage::globals` when a `GDExtension` is loaded in exported builds","user":{"login":"ze2j","id":46556066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTU2MDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46556066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j","html_url":"https://github.com/ze2j","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fix [104056](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104056)\r\n\r\nThe root cause of the issue is that the `GDScriptLanguage::globals` is not updated when a new `GDExtension` is loaded in an exported game. This leads to a GDScript compilation failure when the types defined by the `GDExtension` are used explicitly in `.gd` scripts loaded from a pck file (such as a mod).\r\n\r\nThe logic to handle this already exists (added in [93972](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93972)) but is currently enabled only on editor builds. My proposed fix is to remove that constraint so it also applies to exported builds. I haven’t noticed any side effects, but I’m not very familiar with this part of the engine, so let me know if this isn’t the right approach.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gi